  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Md. Heyat Ansari vs The State Of Jharkhand ... ... ... Opp. ... on 27 August, 2018 Author: Ananda Sen Bench: Ananda Sen In The High Court Of Jharkhand At Ranchi B.A. No. 7085 of 2018 Md. Heyat Ansari ... ... ... Petitioner Versus The State of Jharkhand ... ... ... Opp. Party. ------ Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Ananda Sen. ----- For the petitioner: Mr. Dilip Kumar Jaiswal, Advocate. For the State: Addl. P.P. ------ 02/27.08.2018. Heard learned counsel for the parties.",
    "facts": "It is alleged that 10 unclaimed camels were seized and were entrusted to this petitioner and others with a direction to produce after Bakrid, but the petitioner and others failed to produce the said camels. Counsel for the petitioner submits that the petitioner is in custody since 25.07.2018 and two co-accused persons have been granted bail by a co-ordinate Bench of this Court in B.A. No. 4538 of 2018. Taking into consideration the period of custody and the nature of allegation, I am inclined to release the petitioner on bail.",
